# Removes the 2024 Bootstrap template + 2023 Namecheap parking page from
# public_html. Every path here is in the SFTP backup taken 2026-09-09.
# Deliberately NOT touched: cgi-bin/, .well-known/ (ACME), .ftpquota,
# and index.html (the deploy overwrites it).
